wj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3YcHCMMBKAA"]],1],null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMIBKBQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3YcHCMUBKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMQBKBU",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMYBKBY",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMcBKBc",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMgBKBg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[null,[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCMkBKBk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["年前剛放假還沒除夕前來吃的，之前看到排隊的人潮有點卻步！\n餐點選了特製雞貝鹽拉麵、麵條選手打粗麵，入座前交代硬麵，\n環境乾淨舒適，水很冰涼！\n餐點上桌唆了一口！粗麵口感很好，跟湯也很適配！\n湯頭只能說不愧是源自二屋牡蠣麵的店家、鹽味湯頭乾淨清澈有水準，不僅味美清香甘美食材完全提鮮、所有叉燒都是軟嫩不柴！雞肉有炙燒增香的塊狀叉燒跟舒肥雞胸片。貝類是干貝，雖然個頭不大還好、口感軟糯新鮮，干貝表面有經過炙燒的加持後香味顯得特別濃郁！續麵雖然只有細麵，麵條也同樣頗具水準！硬的麵管夠不怕續，店家只在乎有你有沒有吃飽！續麵後加了特製七味粉來轉換口味真是棒！要不是有稍稍節制，會忍不住想再續麵！\n買單前親切的店員解釋大量豆芽菜是為了豚骨拉麵而準備的！看著店員賣力的甩瀝乾麵條水分，有再再回訪的理由！",null,[0,70]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWR