BHdpUEPQQ3YcHCN0BKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCNwBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3YcHCN8BKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ3IcHCN4BKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["拉麵品項不多，還有飯類很特別！豚骨非常濃郁，不適合單喝，蒜末不手軟的給，還有超級多的豆芽菜⋯每一口都吃得到豆芽菜一度以為是來吃大埔鐵板燒嗎🤣\n\n麵條很出色！很像沖繩鄉土拉麵🍜叉燒非常難吃，除了非常薄還帶筋⋯口感很像生牛肉，就是真的沒烤熟吧！豬肉可以沒熟嗎🆘\n\n看了評論有幾篇都有烙賽嫌疑⋯導致我連冰水也不敢喝了，海鮮干貝也不敢點，畢竟把可能嫌疑排除囉！\n\n換桌率蠻快的，排大概十分鐘可以接受～吃完很口渴，真的滿鹹的⋯\n\n要先寫候位登記，但也沒告知到底要不要先線上點餐？既然有點餐功能註記，還需要紙本寫意義是？叫號靠現場帶位的⋯流程很不清楚！建議可以清楚告知後再決定要不要點單\n\n#拉麵店",null,[0,128]]]],[null,1775413103000000,1775413103000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfTk15Q0lCSzhPT2JkSGd4ejJyS2xGUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfTk15Q0lCSzhPT2JkSGd4ejJyS2xGURoTQ2d3STc4N0t6Z1lRenRDMmt3TQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj52MXQ8tSWAxU-kq8BHdpUEPQQ_2MI4AEoDA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDTkdGdE1XNVViVGcxVGxSS1VWWkhaR0ZrVld3MldqTktNbEpGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDTkdGdE1XNVViVGcxVGxSS1VWWkhaR0ZrVld3MldqTktNbEpGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDTkdGdE1XNVViVGcxVGxSS1VWWkhaR0ZrVld3MldqTktNbEpGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDTkdGdE1XNVViVGcxVGxSS1VWWkhaR0ZrVld3MldqTktNbEpGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEU